  <item>
    <title>EP 15. AI时代，终于不用和人谈恋爱了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bd7109606e5c5940b5837c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bd7109606e5c5940b5837c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 07:48:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「当AI开始创作情歌，人类还剩什么？」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「完美机器人伴侣会终结浪漫爱情吗？」</span></p><span></span><p><span>从ChatGPT到DeepSeek，从智能家居到自动驾驶，人工智能从科幻概念逐渐渗透进日常生活的毛细血管。短短几年，AI工具从让人高呼「仨币吧」发展为令人惊叹「仨币了」，在效率至上的浪潮中，人类创造力的独特性是否会被AI消解？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目围绕AI展开深度对话，三位主播结合影视作品、行业经验和生活场景，畅聊技术革新对人类生活带来的冲击与机遇。从AI音乐生成到代码辅助工具，从智能家居联动到伦理困境的思辨，覆盖多维度视角。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后也向各位听众朋友抛出一个我们讨论未果的问题：当AI无限优化之后，「人」的边界在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>欧阳，在AI公司担任广告导演</span></p><span></span><p><span>小鱼，在AI公司担任机械工程师</span></p><span></span><p><span>小莫，曾在AI公司市场部任职</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听指南】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> AI初印象：《人工智能》和《我，机器人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a> AI音乐创作：2分钟解锁《傻狗说》主题曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> ChatGPT：AI时代的专属情感咨询师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 最差的AI体验揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> AI从业者的AI工具推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 写prompt/提示词的四象限法则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 精准指令的艺术：让AI为你定制一份完美减脂餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> ChatGPT和Deep Seek哪个更好用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1378">22:58</a> 行业地震：AI会颠覆广告行业吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> AI学会创作后，人类艺术家还有价值吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> AI会替代人类还是让我们实现做四休三？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 有朝一日：为什么我不会和AI谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 如果有一个完美人型机器人，你还会和人类结婚吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">43:06</a> AI伴侣是浪漫爱的消费降级吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目中推荐的AI工具】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「Suno」AI音乐创作平台 </span><a href="https://suno.com/" data-url="https://suno.com/"><u><span>suno.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><span>「Codeium chat」pycharm 插件，AI代码工具</span></p><span></span><p><span>「即梦AI」AI绘画/文生图工具 </span><a href="https://jimeng.jianying.com/" data-url="https://jimeng.jianying.com/"><u><span>jimeng.jianying.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><span>「播记」播客时间轴和shownotes生成 </span><a href="https://tools.thehowai.com/boji" data-url="https://tools.thehowai.com/boji"><u><span>tools.thehowai.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《编号89757》——林俊杰</span></p><span></span><p><span>《傻狗发电快乐站》——作词DeepSeek，作曲Suno，以下是歌词：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Verse1：</span></p><span></span><p><span>踩着云朵跳踢踏舞</span></p><span></span><p><span>早八地铁撞见彩虹地图</span></p><span></span><p><span>三只小狗共享心跳频率</span></p><span></span><p><span>摇摇晃晃撞进春天漩涡</span></p><span></span><p><span>副歌：</span></p><span></span><p><span>爪印写诗拆解无聊公式</span></p><span></span><p><span>扑棱抖落满身小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>你听宇宙在打呼噜</span></p><span></span><p><span>WOW WOW～</span></p><span></span><p><span>合唱：</span></p><span></span><p><span>傻狗快乐发电</span></p><span></span><p><span>没头没脑发电</span></p><span></span><p><span>波频率做成狗狗饼干片</span></p><span></span><p><span>快乐在爆米机花里排成列</span></p><span></span><p><span>Verse2：</span></p><span></span><p><span>傻狗快乐发电</span></p><span></span><p><span>偷吃星星被烫到喵喵叫</span></p><span></span><p><span>烦恼丢进洗衣机甩干</span></p><span></span><p><span>晾在阳台上跳草裙舞转圈</span></p><span></span><p><span>桥：（Rap）</span></p><span></span><p><span>三原色女孩调出新宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>斑马线跳房子追着气球</span></p><span></span><p><span>傻狗快乐发电</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的电台永不消磁的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：汪汪！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目提到的电影】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《人工智能（AI）》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmsVrRSHGOuCeEjQ82c095VzC2UY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLYJgt5bYItje6xkHT3TnY9ipes.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《我，机器人（I, Robot）》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FigZgDAJNY5uQWzQ6dIHKSa9rcY9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《她（Her）》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjT91eTY3Bgbv79mrfLkslQnLluk.png"></figure>]]></description>
